<title>UK: LME metals weaker, but off lows in PM trading.</title>
<headline>LME metals weaker, but off lows in PM trading.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Off lows, but little incentive to push higher.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Also off morning's weakest level.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Easier, but regains $7,200.</p>
<p>LEAD - Soft, but stabilises after hitting 20-month lows.</p>
<p>TIN - Unchanged. ZINC - Slightly easier.</p>
</text>
